@startuml
title Proposed recorded settlement (no bank transfer)
actor "Payment sender" as Sender
boundary "Swing / future client" as Client
control "SettlementService" as Service
database "SQL" as DB
Sender -> Client : recipient, amount, paymentDate
Client -> Service : recordPayment(session, stable key, senderId, recipientId, Money)
Service -> DB : authenticate; active group membership; sender = principal
alt unauthorized or inaccessible
  Service --> Client : 401 / 403 / 404; no writes
else authorized
  Service -> DB : lookup own operation key and payload digest
  alt committed same key and payload
    DB --> Service : stored payment result
    Service --> Client : original result; no second payment
  else reused key with different payload
    Service --> Client : 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
  else new command
    Service -> DB : BEGIN; lock group financial row; recheck key replay
    Service -> DB : read current canonical pair projection
    Service -> Service : validate distinct retained members\npositive exact-unit amount, currency, date\nsender is current debtor; amount <= debt
    alt invalid / wrong direction / overpayment
      Service -> DB : ROLLBACK; no financial/history writes
      Service --> Client : 422 domain error with explanation
    else valid
      Service -> DB : insert immutable Payment + unique payment posting\nupdate pair balance, financial sequence, read watermark\nstore operation result
      alt database failure before commit
        Service -> DB : ROLLBACK all writes
        Service --> Client : retryable error; same key on retry
      else commit succeeds
        Service -> DB : COMMIT
        Service --> Client : 201 payment/history ID + pairBalanceAfter + watermark
        note right of Client
          Timeout after commit: outcome unknown.
          Retry same key or query own operation.
          Do not announce offline completion.
        end note
      end
    end
  end
end
Client -> Service : read balances/history with minWatermark
Service -> DB : authorize; snapshot at or after watermark
DB --> Service : current pair + retained payment history
Service --> Client : matching committed views
note bottom of DB
Concurrent settlements and approvals take group lock first.
Second settlement rechecks debt after first commits.
History retained when balance reaches zero or members leave.
end note
@enduml

